---

<Layout
  title="Support Our Mission | hoGAMEGATA"
  description="Help preserve horror gaming history. Support hoGAMEGATA's mission to keep our 107,000+ horror game database free, open, and ad-free."
  statsGames={stats?.games}
  statsDevelopers={stats?.developers}
  statsTags={stats?.tags}
>
  <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center space-y-10 sm:space-y-14">
    {/* Section Header */}
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 bg-red-950/20 border border-red-500/30 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,42,42,0.2)] mx-auto">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 text-red-500 animate-pulse"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white mt-4">
        Support The Mission
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-base text-white/70 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mx-auto font-normal">
        hoGAMEGATA is a free, ad-free database dedicated to horror games and game metadata preservation. We never sell user data or lock features behind paywalls. hoGAMEGATA only collects, stores and serves pre-existing/known games as an aggregator.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Support Methods Grid */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 w-full text-left mt-6">
      {/* 1. Share & Spread */}
      <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#121216] p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-3.5">
          <div class="text-red-400">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
            1. Share the site!
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
            The easiest way to help is to share your favorite game pages, tag combinations, and lists with fellow horror enthusiasts. Help us build a larger community.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest pt-2">and it's free!</span>
      </div>

      {/* 2. Contribute Metadata */}
      <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#121216] p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-3.5">
          <div class="text-emerald-400">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-6 h-6 sm:w-7 sm:h-7"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
            2. Contribute Data
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed">
            Preservation starts with metadata. Report missing details, suggest tags, submit scare ratings, and contribute to retro / abandonware lists to keep the records complete.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest pt-2">Contribution will be available soon!</span>
      </div>

      {/* 3. Patreon & Hosting */}
      <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#121216] p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-white/20 transition-colors">
        <div class="space-y-3.5">
