            Domain, Database hosting, cron jobs, and API requests cost real money and computational power. Support us financially on Ko-Fi or which ever way possible to help cover our direct operating infrastructure costs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest pt-2">Support links will be available soon!</span>
      </div>
    </div>

