          <h3 class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
            Precautions & Disclaimer
          </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/70 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            Although all game links, deal discounts, store pages, and third-party resources are gathered from reliable and trusted platforms, hoGAMEGATA operates solely as an open-access aggregator and metadata catalog.
          </p>
          <p>
            hoGAMEGATA, its maintainers, site owners, and aurostron are not responsible or liable for any external transactions, downloads, third-party software, broken links, inaccuracies, or damages. You visit and interact with external storefronts and third-party websites at your own discretion.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Back Button */}
    <div class="pt-12 select-none">
